OL,3,CNew animal charity president confirms
OL,4,Creform after former CEO jailed
OL,6,FThe new president of Jersey's largest
OL,7,Fanimal charity insists the
OL,8,Forganisation's "checks and balances"
OL,9,Fhave been significantly strengthened,
OL,10,Fsix years since it was defrauded out
OL,11,Fof more than #400,000.
OL,13,FStephen Coleman, the former Chief
OL,14,FOperating Officer of the JSPCA, was
OL,15,Fjailed by the island's Royal Court in
OL,16,F2020 after he used the charity's money
OL,17,Ffor unauthorised pay rises.
OL,19,FHe went on luxury holidays, bought a
OL,20,Fsports car and purchased a new house
OL,21,Fwith his wife.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/6
