OL,3,CNew animal charity president confirms
OL,4,Creform after former CEO jailed
OL,6,FFormer Jersey Advocate Lisa Springate
OL,7,Ftook over as JSPCA President from Ben
OL,8,FShenton in April and is determined to
OL,9,Fcontinue rebuilding trust with the
OL,10,Fpublic.
OL,12,FShe told ITV News: "The people that
OL,13,Fwe've got on board are all from highly
OL,14,Fcommercial backgrounds.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,355,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1785520111
OL,3,CNew animal charity president confirms
OL,4,Creform after former CEO jailed
OL,6,F"We've got accountants, we've got a
OL,7,Fformer police sergeant, so the
OL,8,Fposition is that it just couldn't
OL,9,Fhappen again because at the moment,
OL,10,Fthere are so many checks and balances
OL,11,Fthat we've got with the amount of
OL,12,Fpeople that need to review payments
OL,13,Fout and just generally, in terms of
OL,14,Fanything that's done.
OL,16,F"It just couldn't happen again."
OL,18,FThe JSPCA was founded in 1868 and took
OL,19,Fin 1,400 wild animals last year.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/6
