OL,3,CNew animal charity president confirms
OL,4,Creform after former CEO jailed
OL,6,FIt also looks after domestic pets and
OL,7,Fthe charity says its service costs
OL,8,F#4,000 a day to run.
OL,10,FIt receives no funding from the
OL,11,FGovernment and says it is highly
OL,12,Freliant on money left in people's
OL,13,Fwills to keep going.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/6
