OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1785520111
OL,3,CNew animal charity president confirms
OL,4,Creform after former CEO jailed
OL,6,FMs Springate hopes to help the charity
OL,7,Ffind more sustainable income sources,
OL,8,Fexplaining: "We're looking to
OL,9,Fstrengthen our donor network and we've
OL,10,Fhad quite a few meetings in the last
OL,11,Ffew weeks in relation to that, but
OL,12,Fwe're also looking at ways to raise
OL,13,Fthe profile of the charity more."
OL,15,FSpeaking about her motivation for
OL,16,Ftaking on the leading role, Ms
OL,17,FSpringate says she wants "to give back
OL,18,Fto the community".
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/6
